Package: com.brend0n.fpsindicator
Name: FPSIndicator
Version: 0.0.4.2-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Real-time in-game FPS indicator (injection-friendly fork). Shows an FPS label overlay; works with LiveContainer / sideload dylib injection as well as rootless jailbreaks. Fork changes: fixed Metal frame counting (CAMetalLayer.nextDrawable instead of the CAMetalDrawable protocol), enabled by default without a preference file, optional per-app config at Documents/FPSIndicator.plist.
Maintainer: zxhzxhz
Author: brend0n
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
